{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>מאור, אזן, פורע, יראת</b> — four word-pairs. [See Genesis 31:33] Likewise the interpretation: <b>מאור</b> — what the eyes behold, <b>he will rejoice the heart</b>; and when the ear hears reproof, in it too there is life; and he will lodge among the wise — then reproof will fatten him more than a good report."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:04.429151497Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}